    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Beyond Enemy Lines - Vietnam is a tactical first person shooter set in the Vietnam War!</strong></h2><br>You are onboard of a helicopter on the way back to HQ after a top secret mission. Your helicopter gets hit by aan vietnamese RPG and crashes into the vietnamese jungle - you are the only survivor! Your task is to survive and find a way to HQ and deliver your captured informations.<br><br>You have total freedom to choose your path - guns blazing or silent assassin - it's your choice! Beyond Enemy Lines - Vietnam is an unforgiving, intense experience where skill and tactical decisions matter!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Nonlinear Story Campaign<br></li><li> <strong>Detailed Weapon Customization</strong><br></li><li> Unlock new weapons and weapon attachements for <strong>New Game +</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Variete of controllable vehicles</strong><br></li><li> 100% Combat Sandbox, you are free to approach you every mission objective in your way!<br></li><li> Different mission areas from jungle to villages and cities<br></li><li> Detailed mission rating system<br></li><li> From the ground up reengineered AI<br></li><li> Unreal Engine 5 and full Lumen Reflection and Global Illumination support<br></li><li> And more to be revealed ..</li></ul><br>Find out more details and features in the coming months. Make sure to Wishlist <strong>Beyond Enemy Lines - Vietnam</strong> and Follow us on social media!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Beyond Enemy Lines - Vietnam is a tactical first person shooter set in the Vietnam War!</strong></h2><br>You are onboard of a helicopter on the way back to HQ after a top secret mission. Your helicopter gets hit by aan vietnamese RPG and crashes into the vietnamese jungle - you are the only survivor! Your task is to survive and find a way to HQ and deliver your captured informations.<br><br>You have total freedom to choose your path - guns blazing or silent assassin - it's your choice! Beyond Enemy Lines - Vietnam is an unforgiving, intense experience where skill and tactical decisions matter!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Nonlinear Story Campaign<br></li><li> <strong>Detailed Weapon Customization</strong><br></li><li> Unlock new weapons and weapon attachements for <strong>New Game +</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Variete of controllable vehicles</strong><br></li><li> 100% Combat Sandbox, you are free to approach you every mission objective in your way!<br></li><li> Different mission areas from jungle to villages and cities<br></li><li> Detailed mission rating system<br></li><li> From the ground up reengineered AI<br></li><li> Unreal Engine 5 and full Lumen Reflection and Global Illumination support<br></li><li> And more to be revealed ..</li></ul><br>Find out more details and features in the coming months. Make sure to Wishlist <strong>Beyond Enemy Lines - Vietnam</strong> and Follow us on social media!",
    "short_description": "Take the role of a U.S. Special Forces soldier crashed into the vietnamese jungle on the return of a top secret mission. Adapt to jungle warfare, make your tactics and survive!",
